#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up an online lab environment to use Qiskit in the cloud. Choose a preconfigured environment or set up your own."
msgstr "Configure un environnement de lab en ligne pour utiliser Qiskit dans le cloud. Choisis un environnement préconfiguré ou configure le tien."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments"
msgstr "Environnements de lab en ligne"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments {#online-lab-environments}"
msgstr "Environnements de lab en ligne {#online-lab-environments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to downloading and installing Qiskit to work on your local machine, there are several options available for those who prefer to work in an online development environment.\n"
msgstr "En plus de télécharger et d'installer Qiskit pour travailler sur ta machine locale, plusieurs options sont disponibles pour ceux qui préfèrent travailler dans un environnement de développement en ligne.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Several providers offer online Jupyter environments with Qiskit preinstalled for fast and convenient onboarding. These recommended providers include the cloud service provider OVHcloud and the quantum software development cloud platform qBraid.\n"
msgstr "Plusieurs fournisseurs proposent des environnements Jupyter en ligne avec Qiskit préinstallé pour une prise en main rapide et pratique. Ces fournisseurs recommandés incluent le fournisseur de services cloud OVHcloud et la plateforme cloud de développement logiciel quantique qBraid.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended notebook environments with Qiskit preinstalled {#recommended-notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"
msgstr "Environnements de notebook recommandés avec Qiskit préinstallé {#recommended-notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional online Jupyter notebook environments like IBM Watson&reg; Studio, Google Colab, and Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio can be used to work with Qiskit by following the appropriate instructions.\n"
msgstr "D'autres environnements de notebooks Jupyter en ligne comme IBM Watson&reg; Studio, Google Colab et Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio peuvent être utilisés pour travailler avec Qiskit en suivant les instructions appropriées.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVHcloud AI notebooks {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"
msgstr "Notebooks AI OVHcloud {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVHcloud Public Cloud and OVHcloud Startup users can use their OVHcloud quantum notebooks to access Qiskit and submit jobs to IBM&reg; QPUs with their IBM Quantum&reg; or IBM Cloud&reg; account. To learn more, visit the [OVHcloud Documentation and tutorials](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-documentation?id=kb_home) page.\n"
msgstr "Les utilisateurs d'OVHcloud Public Cloud et d'OVHcloud Startup peuvent utiliser leurs notebooks quantiques OVHcloud pour accéder à Qiskit et soumettre des jobs aux QPU IBM&reg; avec leur compte IBM Quantum&reg; ou IBM Cloud&reg;. Pour en savoir plus, consulte la page [Documentation et tutoriels OVHcloud](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-documentation?id=kb_home).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"OVHcloud AI notebooks are not available in some regions, such as the United States. Additionally, user interfaces might look different in different regions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Les notebooks AI OVHcloud ne sont pas disponibles dans certaines régions, comme les États-Unis. De plus, les interfaces utilisateur peuvent différer selon les régions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to get started:\n"
msgstr "Suis ces étapes pour commencer :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Crée un compte IBM Cloud](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up an OVHcloud account](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"
msgstr "[Configure un compte OVHcloud](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an OVH Public Cloud project](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"
msgstr "[Crée un projet OVH Public Cloud](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the steps in [Launch your first AI Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), selecting **Qiskit** for the framework.\n"
msgstr "Suis les étapes de [Lancement de ton premier notebook AI](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), en sélectionnant **Qiskit** comme framework.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"
msgstr "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit users can use qBraid's preconfigured Python environments by following these instructions. For more information, see the [qBraid Docs](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"
msgstr "Les utilisateurs de Qiskit peuvent utiliser les environnements Python préconfigurés de qBraid en suivant ces instructions. Pour plus d'informations, consulte la [documentation qBraid](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up an qBraid free account](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"
msgstr "[Crée un compte qBraid gratuit](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Lab environment](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-started).\n"
msgstr "[Crée un environnement Lab](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launch qBraid Lab, click the **ENVS** icon on the right, click **+ ADD** at the top of the new sidebar, and search for Qiskit.  Click the version you want to use, then click **Install**.\n"
msgstr "Lance qBraid Lab, clique sur l'icône **ENVS** à droite, clique sur **+ ADD** en haut de la nouvelle barre latérale, et recherche Qiskit. Clique sur la version que tu veux utiliser, puis clique sur **Install**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Jupyter notebook by clicking **Python 3 [Qiskit]** in the Notebook section.\n"
msgstr "Crée un notebook Jupyter en cliquant sur **Python 3 [Qiskit]** dans la section Notebook.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can install any additional Python packages (Such as Qiskit v1.2) in a notebook cell by running `%pip install [package_name].` For more information, see the [Pip (magic) commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-commands) topic.\n"
msgstr "Tu peux installer des packages Python supplémentaires (comme Qiskit v1.2) dans une cellule de notebook en exécutant `%pip install [package_name].` Pour plus d'informations, consulte la rubrique [Commandes Pip (magic)](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-commands).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional notebook environments for Qiskit users {#additional-notebook-environments-for-qiskit-users}"
msgstr "Autres environnements de notebooks pour les utilisateurs de Qiskit {#additional-notebook-environments-for-qiskit-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For platforms without Qiskit preconfigured, the setup instructions are similar, except that you must install Qiskit manually. You will create an account, start a new project (or notebook or workspace, depending on the platform), and install Qiskit.\n"
msgstr "Pour les plateformes sans Qiskit préconfiguré, les instructions de configuration sont similaires, sauf que tu dois installer Qiskit manuellement. Tu devras créer un compte, démarrer un nouveau projet (ou notebook ou espace de travail, selon la plateforme), et installer Qiskit.\n"

